[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack/issues/comments/635982388","html_url":"https://github.com/webpack/webpack/issues/10966#issuecomment-635982388","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack/issues/10966","id":635982388,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDYzNTk4MjM4OA==","user":{"login":"ahwitz","id":3514397,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTQzOTc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3514397?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahwitz","html_url":"https://github.com/ahwitz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahwitz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahwitz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahwitz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahwitz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahwitz/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahwitz/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahwitz/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahwitz/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahwitz/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2020-05-29T13:48:53Z","updated_at":"2020-05-29T13:48:53Z","body":"Ran `git bisect` and traced it to https://github.com/webpack/webpack/commit/352ecd0c3add237448ae307679afe23c4f364e48. Changing https://github.com/webpack/webpack/blob/master/lib/FileSystemInfo.js#L894 to `commonMap.size < 1` fixes the issue and made sense from an outsider's perspective, unless a \"snapshot\" is specifically intended to be n > 2 files.\r\n\r\nI have a PR ready for that fix (from https://github.com/ahwitz/webpack/commit/74fdde8888078ea01dd48aa4073a1ae84e2dda4f), but because a) I'm not so sure about that \"unless\" and b) I couldn't find any tests that broke because of this/correspond to this, I'm hesitant to submit it. Let me know if you want me to put that in and I can.","author_